      ]
    ]
  },
  "previewImage": "",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "82073407-c711-41d9-88ea-4748b9db7fa1",
      "type": "subheader",
      "html": "🚩Forbidden Questions.",
      "anchorId": "forbidden-questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "a01bacb8-a72e-4c93-b9e5-2e06f95a9263",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "432ccae4-c621-45d9-ac7b-05e3b696bf27",
      "type": "quote",
      "html": "First and foremost, there are certain things that should <u>never</u> be discussed during an interview..."
    },
    {
      "id": "1f9a9682-bfb1-4692-90b8-ec20fb569d8b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "...but that especially you, in a position of potential vulnerability as an applicant looking for work, have a right to <strong>categorically refuse to answer.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "04fcc895-bcb2-4a10-9db3-4f2bc5b725e0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "If the interviewer is insistent you answer questions about <strong>any</strong> of the following, it should be considered a <strong>major</strong> <strong>red flag</strong> and you should reconsider proceeding any further in the application process with the company:"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4329e73-f9fb-426f-88e0-db3801bf216a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Age (unless for verifying over 18)."
    },
    {
      "id": "228884bc-ef90-4677-8913-0d91e2a598d7",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Disabilities or medical conditions (unless to verify ability to perform essential job functions)."
    },
    {
      "id": "df9ae35f-68de-4f9b-85c9-bc74f0a05cb6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Marital status."
    },
    {
      "id": "d6ac5b49-b13f-4ef9-a2e0-6f06964cb699",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Pregnancy status, plans to have children, and/or family status."
    },
    {
      "id": "57e4fc3c-db6c-4644-b6c5-504ac2c55f5b",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Personal Financial status."
    },
    {
      "id": "f00d6bd4-3957-4070-844f-d579f3bb8da2",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Salary History and/or Current Salary."
    },
    {
      "id": "312a468d-c606-44c7-8540-fd62418a65ee",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Religious affiliation."
    },
    {
      "id": "efdb5224-3f75-4247-9898-0267cdc0f272",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Gender (unless in the interest of referring to you by your preferred pronoun)."
    },
    {
      "id": "65b03434-35ca-4a00-80be-63780aec18be",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Sexual orientation."
    },
    {
      "id": "ecb4a9a4-ee7a-4f68-8fdd-ba37c2a1bb5c",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Drug habits (including legal)."
    },
    {
      "id": "f56fab9a-70b0-49e5-9f75-61be3c73f3b4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Race / Ethnicity."
    },
    {
      "id": "751db13b-ecc6-4ff2-b83f-12f832dc07a1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Please note that at a purely legal level, these do change from country to country, but nobody should be asking any of these regardless."
    },
    {
      "id": "a033933a-bf95-448a-a11f-455d374f71d9",
      "type": "subheader",
      "html": "💹 Salary Questions.",
      "anchorId": "salary-questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "28c7d4c0-cd22-4e10-8419-37a158bd57a4",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee0415ab-bf91-477e-ac97-1f9def0ee788",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "During the interview process, as early as your first phone call with a recruiter, you are likely to receive questions about how much you should be payed, so it is essential for you to be prepared."
    },
    {
      "id": "c1183935-d63d-466b-89ac-d82f78bc11e3",
      "type": "callout",
      "html": "As stated in the <a href=\"#/interview-q-and-as\"><em>Forbidden Questions</em></a>, you are under no obligation to disclose your<strong> current salary</strong> to anyone you speak with during the entirety of the process. <br>You can expect to be pressured to reveal this number on several occasions, but if you absolutely <em>must</em> provide a figure, it should at the very least represent your <em>desired</em> salary range rather than your <em><em><em><em><em><em><em>current</em></em></em></em></em></em></em> salary.<br>For further tips on how to navigate this process, refer to the ‣ section.",
      "icon": "⚠️",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "340efa7a-d78a-43da-b567-9d576d7bb774",
      "type": "subheader",
      "html": "😌 Questions &amp; Answers.",
      "anchorId": "questions-and-answers"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab682997-b65d-4ff5-9dba-1329c40d583b",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "83d1486d-0b0c-4887-a63d-0347e4469d75",
      "type": "quote",
      "html": "Below you can find a list of some common questions you may be asked during interviews, as well as some questions <em>you</em> can use to determine if an opportunity will be a good fit for what you are looking for."
    },
    {
      "id": "e9feb6e9-76fc-4f0b-94cd-f23c7e639348",
      "type": "callout",
      "html": "Please note that the lists below are in no shape or form substitutes for doing your own research on the company and products they create, and coming up with bespoke questions based on those.<strong><br></strong>Additionally, the list of questions and answers below should only be used to check for potential blind spots in your preparation process, and to ensure you have not ommited anything that may be important to touch on.",
      "icon": "⚠️",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "514e7feb-5a10-43bf-bd32-b7cac7f1ea8b",
      "type": "columns",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "bccc326a-8e35-4fd5-aff8-2b926e204ce8",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "a0a0e72f-12b5-4e56-a9b0-fadd74f75857",
              "type": "subheader",
              "html": "❗Be Prepared to Answer.",
              "anchorId": "be-prepared-to-answer"
            },
            {
              "id": "d513d243-cf10-4e70-9454-2f5b4bdd6c2c",
              "type": "divider"
            },
            {
              "id": "41b47077-3bae-4370-98f0-d3a291012a7f",
              "type": "subsubheader",
              "html": "Stage 1: The Pre-Screen Phase.",
              "anchorId": "stage-1-the-pre-screen-phase"
            },
            {
              "id": "0b21cbb1-4114-4975-ad8f-5371a240b9cc",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em>Generally conducted with a Recruiter or a member of HR.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "1cd1d134-5e5b-477f-bdfa-0d5e9278b61e",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Your salary expectations (even if you are planning to keep to yourself as outlined in ‣)."
            },
            {
              "id": "f79553c7-f956-4f1b-a7c1-fef575d813ae",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "How soon you would be able to begin this new position."
            },
            {
              "id": "55ad22f8-d562-4999-b97e-2fa8d7d06c95",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Your origin story in UI, and a brief overview of your professional/academic history."
            },
            {
              "id": "5a77af8a-addf-4679-ba24-610ccf7d7cb2",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Why you are looking to move from your current position."
            },
            {
              "id": "4d94fb4e-9073-4f89-a31f-79dc37f68f55",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Why you are interested in working at this studio."
            },
            {
              "id": "13a8820b-94e7-40cd-bbb8-091cde89c5ad",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Some interesting stories or anecdotes about your professional growth."
            },
            {
              "id": "3edc45e6-4375-47ea-9e90-633d4752ce41",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What kind of work you are looking to do."
            },
            {
              "id": "205f6f8f-79ea-4280-b615-c080ba0fc336",
              "type": "subsubheader",
              "html": "Stage 2: Interview With the Hiring Manager(s).",
              "anchorId": "stage-2-interview-with-the-hiring-manager-s"
            },
            {
              "id": "52f4fc61-e2d0-406a-8ad2-7230a4ac363c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em>Generally conducted with a Hiring Manager and 1-2 members of their entourage.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "8e19de83-9390-4435-85ef-1bf7a7b9b842",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "How you would potentially improve the studio's current products' UI."
            },
            {
              "id": "6907bc65-6c33-467f-bb3c-66f0927bb5c2",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Game UIs &amp; UXs that you think are bad, and how you would improve them."
            },
            {
              "id": "cf59bd15-70b6-477a-9f1c-7983aacc6a9e",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What you are playing at the moment."
            },
            {
              "id": "65487f64-c674-4eab-a951-0d274e7b8228",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Your favourite games."
            },
            {
              "id": "b8ecc83a-e20e-4950-911f-a90b74855dec",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Your favourite historical game UIs."
            },
            {
              "id": "f80824ad-4049-4826-9f12-1db22513f7eb",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Your favourite current game UIs."
            },
            {
              "id": "592503f8-ee95-47b9-aa08-df80aa98434e",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What upcoming game you are most excited about."
            },
            {
              "id": "ce3a8a80-b5ac-4cc4-9a6b-ba0fee2c4551",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What you are most excited about in games and technology."
            },
            {
              "id": "fb7cadfd-fb74-4012-8e7b-78e5af25303d",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What areas you are looking to grow in professionally."
            },
            {
              "id": "9286a93c-a7a4-4b14-85ee-a89f1ad35d59",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "If you consider yourself more 'UI' or 'UX'."
            },
            {
              "id": "939d195c-96aa-4462-8600-1c5bc5660e62",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "New trends you are noticing in game UI."
            },
            {
              "id": "049dda7f-5f8c-45f7-aae2-7debe7b5ec51",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Favourite Graphic Designers."
            },
            {
              "id": "915322d9-51c2-4a78-8d5c-327234880382",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Trends in Graphic Design."
            },
            {
              "id": "8aeaaa70-8ba1-4e04-8dc8-fb71c3f4db55",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Favourite Artists."
            },
            {
              "id": "579a1fb1-12fd-4968-9d04-584a0cb91481",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What kind of work you are looking to do more of."
            },
            {
              "id": "ce039873-08db-4f80-88d7-1071d85d51f8",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What kind of work you enjoy doing the least."
            },
            {
              "id": "6a44f911-1526-45f4-856b-ade04d05c159",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What aspect of UI development you find the most challenging."
            },
            {
              "id": "dabb7080-b1da-4ebe-9d14-9da44eedc271",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What inspires you."
            },
            {
              "id": "8f622738-11ca-48f1-ad08-6fe7c677a460",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "A challenging team dynamics situation that you overcame."
            },
            {
              "id": "4adccc61-f30a-41ed-b028-b30d5a195786",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "An overview of your responsibilities in your previous position."
            },
            {
              "id": "09750ea6-de10-4b1f-a0e8-b0a2299b2685",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What you are most proud of professionally."
            },
            {
              "id": "f330ef22-268f-4c7c-8424-c8b6d267aecc",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Which projects of yours you'd like to specifically talk about, and what makes them special to you."
            },
            {
              "id": "8ed1c3ff-e1f0-4180-9f5c-e4084f4e8ad9",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What process you are used to for making UI."
            },
            {
              "id": "125d849a-4d0b-4084-b3bf-8b1da5d95b5b",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What your workflow is for developing UI screens."
            },
            {
              "id": "7a2378c3-2ef7-4cd9-b5b3-675b9cb65866",
              "type": "subsubheader",
              "html": "Stage 3: Meeting The Team.",
              "anchorId": "stage-3-meeting-the-team"
            },
            {
              "id": "51f3545e-8cab-4f59-bb27-e242f2baf906",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em>Generally conducted with members of the wider team you will potentially be working with.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "b728b6a9-48a4-4e53-9d0d-a3bb2a9311a8",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "A lot of similar answers will be shared with Stage 2, but otherwise:"
            },
            {
              "id": "05758490-b1d8-4fc0-bd20-bdff07efb3bf",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Passions and hobbies outside of work."
            },
            {
              "id": "87d6dbc5-0634-4a06-b277-801cc06fda02",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What you think is an example of great game design."
            },
            {
              "id": "e3791f53-f68c-4463-ae23-36a85692f0da",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What your favourite games, or genre of games are."
            },
            {
              "id": "83a82996-ce56-4d37-9ae9-2c1c1f7d551b",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dd2f3e9d-7f0d-4a95-98be-456b9ca31d82",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "0ea81cb6-2379-417c-9a61-06152457da62",
              "type": "subheader",
              "html": "❓ Questions to Ask.",
              "anchorId": "questions-to-ask"
            },
            {
              "id": "d6c3608a-80c7-4ca0-b2b8-21cde52d5b89",
              "type": "divider"
            },
            {
              "id": "88021192-eab9-4b75-8861-321b8c2f72f1",
              "type": "subsubheader",
              "html": "Stage 1: The Pre-Screen.",
              "anchorId": "stage-1-the-pre-screen"
            },
            {
              "id": "6c940d85-24e9-4c11-8855-76c43bb090c2",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em>Generally conducted with a Recruiter or a member of HR.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "f3d17644-68ce-41e3-b0d7-532128f9c991",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What are the philosophies and values of the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "8d1bb7e4-91db-45a3-b9e5-85a5819910f2",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the current studio size?"
            },
            {
              "id": "57ad4e6f-0749-491f-98e9-48f0b5201160",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "How big is the UI Team currently?"
            },
            {
              "id": "ab89800a-1d9a-4997-b358-95a7cb56e70c",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the studio vision for the UI Department/Discipline?"
            },
            {
              "id": "e4e2b0b4-053a-468a-aa9f-184edfcb68cc",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the studio looking to achieve with this role?"
            },
            {
              "id": "6d3006f4-59c8-4c51-8030-f5abe99f3498",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What UI sub-disciplines exist within the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "539c08a8-2a27-4912-ab7e-611527787253",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What can you tell me about the project?"
            },
            {
              "id": "434f989b-32f3-4c65-b7a1-2dd5729627fe",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What are the long term business goals of the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "df27aaba-f888-41ac-967e-94f7cbbbeabf",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the parent company's vision for the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "c5a0402a-6910-453d-a4f2-dcf5baf96f24",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the relationship like with the studio's parent company?"
            },
            {
              "id": "7bb720f5-9400-4cc7-804d-c5f646c84dbb",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "How much independence do have from the parent studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "ed437f72-de8a-45ef-b15f-a2ae3e9bd15e",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What learning &amp; development opportunities exist at the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "6fd09db4-a365-4341-aba2-aacaafaa52fd",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the studio doing for accessibility?"
            },
            {
              "id": "2995791f-c17a-46c1-9415-2e7d941fe0ea",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What measures exist at the studio to ensure representation, diversity, and equity?"
            },
            {
              "id": "cbd39795-bb1d-4db5-823d-f23c6ad34615",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the best thing about working at the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "9d5e9b0d-8be1-4da5-ab40-26228727f4c2",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "If you could change one thing about working at the studio, what would it be?"
            },
            {
              "id": "c47769b3-5ba2-45f8-8f69-2cbebc91fda1",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the salary band for this role?"
            },
            {
              "id": "5822729c-2217-4d33-9f75-2496337c956b",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What do you typically offer in terms of relocation packages?"
            },
            {
              "id": "ec4a0432-ef1f-4717-bd9e-087e63420230",
              "type": "subsubheader",
              "html": "Stage 2: Interview With the Hiring Manager(s).",
              "anchorId": "stage-2-interview-with-the-hiring-manager-s-2"
            },
            {
              "id": "404ede8c-8345-4117-9330-0aa67da4858c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em>Generally conducted with a Hiring Manager and 1-2 members of their entourage.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "6c315c55-cd2e-4dc9-9bfa-5f0dec927937",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What inspires you personally?"
            },
            {
              "id": "e41f1172-c999-4ed9-872a-adf68b2555de",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What games are you playing these days?"
            },
            {
              "id": "6cd655dd-f9aa-42ba-9b5e-8c19dadc5076",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Can you tell me a little bit about your role within the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "36f5a903-7387-4dbb-90f8-32fadd3b5118",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "Can you tell me a little about how the UI Team is structured?"
            },
            {
              "id": "153449c6-9926-4958-bca9-64efd7ca8184",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is your vision for growth and/or development of the UI Team?"
            },
            {
              "id": "ea7a1619-61b3-4e0a-87d5-a3d140cfe916",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What kind of documentation systems do you employ?"
            },
            {
              "id": "891c634f-94ad-4607-815e-5867be7a537a",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the best thing about working at the studio?"
            },
            {
              "id": "bc5d8433-5c75-4960-87a6-2a8df4943a5e",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "If you could change one thing about working at the studio, what would it be?"
            },
            {
              "id": "5529857a-01c4-45a2-99fb-27d060644e1f",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What is the teams process/workflow for making UI?"
            },
            {
              "id": "f4e1b57d-ccc2-4b10-9da7-df28447675a7",
              "type": "bulleted_list",
              "html": "What tools do you use to make UI?"
            },
            {
